{"id":"189177d39c46a492","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-recursive-computable-set.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Computable Set","display":"df-zfc-recursive-computable-set — ZFC Recursive Computable Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-computable-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-computable-set"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-computable-set — ZFC Recursive Computable Set","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-computable-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-computable-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-computable-set — ZFC Recursive Computable Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"243e4a6577a71cc8\" href=\"?note=243e4a6577a71cc8\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in V\">\\(A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\)</span> (canonical decidable-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveComputableSet}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveComputableSet}_S(A)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}computable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveComputableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}computable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveComputableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>“Computable set” and “decidable set” are exact aliases here. The imported predicate already requires a total computation of the characteristic function, so no second untyped machine notation is introduced.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"243e4a6577a71cc8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-recursion3-decidable-set.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveComputableSet}_S(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}computable\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveComputableSet}_S(A)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion3DecidableSet}_S(A)","display":true}],"bytes":968,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3280","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-recursive-computable-set.md|58-df-zfc-recursive-computable-set]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["243e4a6577a71cc8"]}